\b Appendix C: Validation Procedure\b0\par
\par
Validation is performed at three levels:\par
\par
1. Dataset validation: verify row counts, required columns, and exact-ready field rows.\par
2. Model validation: measure availability accuracy, juvenile-risk accuracy, weighted F1, RMSE, MAE, and R2.\par
3. Logic validation: verify exact maturity-rule behavior, fallback behavior, and safe-zone response.\par
\par
